        "slc_d1a8ebf172eb8a16a432a321d199cfb1b6e4a4a58ef4f715417d59d7176d10ac"
      ],
      "text": "Rather than limiting exploration, vix strips whitespace characters from file content via a virtual filesystem so the LLM works on minified code, reportedly reducing tokens by 20-50%."
